The classes for `k = 57` (`positive_k.json`):
* `(-3, -3, -9, -3)` is impossible modulo 3.
* `(-1, -9, -6, -4)` is irreducible: `F(u, v) = −N((u + 3v) − vz)` in `ℤ[z]`, `z³ = (21) z + (-40)`. Its only solution `(−1, 0)` comes from `RankOneSources.K57.source0` (unit generation and the Skolem zero set).
